    "summary": "Painting on cotton of a priest seated beneath a tree preaching to his twelve students in a rural setting. The priest wears a white turban, and blue cloak, to the left are eight students wearing white shawls (shamma),one with a book on a reading stand and two students with skin cloaks. To the right are two students, one paler with red hair with his head in his hands. The buildings to the left are a church complex and to the right round houses (tukuls).",
